      "updated_at": "2026-08-02T09:45:30Z",
      "body": "Confirmed compatibility report submitted: https://github.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/pull/5\n\n- **Status:** ingame\n- **Release:** v0.1.6\n- **Device:** OnePlus 13 · Snapdragon 8 Elite (Adreno 830, Android 16)\n- **Driver:** Vortek (System Driver, Experimental) — device system Vulkan driver 0800.74\n- **Evidence commit:** `1bf32d910ac51dbbacd1a99b8808ef063c4958c9`\n\nReaches controllable gameplay in Green Hill Zone Act 1 at ~60 FPS on the experimental Vortek driver (avg 59.9, min 51.0, max 60.3). A Vortek host-loader thread deterministically crashes with SIGSEGV throughout the session; the crash reporter recovers each time so rendering continues, but the shadPS4 log floods with repeated reports. Full-game completion was not verified, so status is ingame.\n\n### Screenshots\n\n![Sonic Mania — v0.1.6 — ingame](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/1bf32d910ac51dbbacd1a99b8808ef063c4958c9/assets/CUSA07023/20260802T094302Z-v0-1-6-oneplus-13-snapdragon-8-elite-vortek-system-driver-0800-74/screenshots/01.webp)\n\n![Sonic Mania — v0.1.6 — ingame](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/1bf32d910ac51dbbacd1a99b8808ef063c4958c9/assets/CUSA07023/20260802T094302Z-v0-1-6-oneplus-13-snapdragon-8-elite-vortek-system-driver-0800-74/screenshots/02.webp)\n",
      "author_association": "OWNER",
